    <aside class="toc-sidebar">
      <nav aria-label="Table of Contents">
        <div class="toc-heading">In This Article</div>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#what-is-biofouling" target="_top">What Is Marine Biofouling?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#coating-types" target="_top">Antifouling Coating Systems</a></li>
          <li><a href="#spc-chemistry" target="_top">Self-Polishing Copolymer Chemistry</a></li>
          <li><a href="#biocide-technology" target="_top">Biocide Technology &amp; Actives</a></li>
          <li><a href="#regulatory-framework" target="_top">Regulatory Framework &amp; TBT</a></li>
          <li><a href="#foul-release" target="_top">Foul-Release Coatings</a></li>
          <li><a href="#application-maintenance" target="_top">Application &amp; Dry-Dock Intervals</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" target="_top">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
